{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is based on the abstract ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":", uses all the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" kit and brings the Sosh brand colors and assets.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This theme embeds and registers the fonts for the Sosh theme, you just need to use the theme object as is."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme does not embed colors for charts yet and is read only: it cannot be subclassed or derivated"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to use the theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" directly. To use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":" for your root view and give it an instance of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Keep in mind the themes are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: SoshTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-tune-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to tune the theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You cannot tune the Sosh theme.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Typography","level":2,"text":"Typography"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sosh theme uses its Sosh font and must not use others.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme","level":2,"text":"How to enrich the theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You cannot derivate the Sosh theme.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-it-looks-like","level":2,"text":"How it looks like"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Actions","level":3,"text":"Actions"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Button","level":4,"text":"Button"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_button_Sosh.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"hea